山洞里面他们说OOXX就OOXX，有没有考虑别人的感受啊？而且OOXX的还不止是一对，那毫不掩饰嘹亮的呻/吟声让莫忆儿脸色发红，头皮发麻，听了几分钟，实在忍不住站起身走出山洞。山洞外面有几个强装的男人守着，似乎是在放哨，看到莫忆儿走出来，虎着脸对他叽里呱啦的说着什么。莫忆儿听不懂，只能迷茫的看着他们。山洞外面的动静很快就惊醒了潜眠的男人，就是救了莫忆儿的那个帅哥，莫忆儿虽然听不懂他们说话，不过也听清他们叫他时的发音——幡戈。很奇怪的名字不是吗？幡戈走过来，似乎在询问自己的同伴，说了两句，就拉着莫忆儿往回走。莫忆儿脸上还有着薄红，她指着山洞里面，拒绝走进去，然后又指指外面，意思是想在外面待一会儿。幡戈听不明白，也很着急，只是使劲儿的拉着她，不让她到处走。莫忆儿很固执，不过远处传来的狼嚎让她心里发颤，她看着幡戈，眸中泛着水光，一副楚楚可怜的样子。丫的，姐这招百试百灵，当年姐姐可是每次都被这招搞的心软，然后任由自己胡作非为的！可是，今天莫忆儿失算了，也许原始人根本就没长那根怜香惜玉的弦。幡戈半拖半拽的把莫忆儿弄回了山洞，按在兔子皮上，然后抱着肩膀看着她，眼中竟然有那么一丁点威胁的意思！莫忆儿顿时就想抓狂，可是，想想说什么这原始人也听不懂，还是算了吧！有这么点纠结的情绪，那些靡靡之音就在耳中分散了许多，莫忆儿也强忍着不适，睡了过去。她不知道的是，在她睡去之后，幡戈的眼中盛满了笑意。原始人都是习惯于日落而息，日出而作，当天边亮起一抹白光，他们便从睡梦中苏醒，所有的人都起来，开始一天的忙碌。莫忆儿睡得正香，就被这些大嗓门给吵醒。原始人没有什么发出噪音不道德的意识，扯着嗓门叽里呱啦。莫忆儿也只好坐起身，肥大的睡裙让她似乎显得更加瘦小了，她的穿着在山洞里面显得是那样的格格不入。没有几分钟，山洞里面的男人们就都不见了，只剩下几个老人和小孩，还有一个大着肚子的女人。莫忆儿来到山洞外面，有女人抱着兽皮往远处走去，有的则是把昨天猎回来的野猪肉晒在山洞前面的空地上。莫忆儿伸了个懒腰，习惯性的想要洗脸刷牙，可是她没发现哪里有水，想要问问，语言又不通，只能自己去寻找，可是没走几步，就被一个女人拉住。这个女人个子很高，足有180cm，不光是她，这群原始人每一个都要比莫忆儿高，还很健壮。莫忆儿转头看向女人，用疑惑的目光看着她。女人叽里呱啦的对着莫忆儿喊，虽说是喊，但看不出半点的不尊敬，反而眼神中还有丝忐忑不安。莫忆儿纠结了，到底在说什么？索性不理睬，继续往外走。可是胳膊被女人死死的禁锢住，就是不放开。莫忆儿终于发觉，女人是不让她离开，买噶，不过是在他们的山洞里面住了一个晚上，难道就被囚禁了？四下看了眼，想找带自己回来的那个男人，显然他和自己多少能沟通一下，可是出乎意料的，山洞外面也没有一个男人。莫忆儿只能垂头丧气的回到山洞门口坐下，这会儿没人再阻拦她做什么了。女人又去一旁晒肉，但目光时不时的朝着莫忆儿看来，颇有监视的意味。莫忆儿呆坐了半晌，然后走回山洞，贪睡的小孩子们也都起来在山洞里面嬉闹，几个老人像是朽木一样坐在山洞深处，不时的说上几句什么。莫忆儿想了想，朝着他们走去。几个老人察觉她的靠近，便打起了精神，唇边都带有笑意，还有那么一分讨好的意味。莫忆儿深吸了一口气，指了指自己，然后大声说着：“我……莫忆儿！”“偶……木木儿？”其中一个年纪最老，头发花白，胡子也很长的老人疑惑的开口。莫忆儿有些着急，又指着自己重复了一遍：“莫忆儿！”“穆伊尔？”“么一二？”老人们都跟着念，不过发音不是很标准，但看他们的神色，应该是知道莫忆儿想和他们交流。年纪最老的老人拍了拍自己的胸脯，然后也咧着嘴大声说：“咖萨！咖萨！”“咖萨？”莫忆儿学着他的口型，然后不确定的发音，一出口，几位老人就笑了，显然，莫忆儿的发音很准！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 3 Imprisoned + babbling Xueyu thought clearly, the sky was getting dark, which meant that night was coming. People were also lying down to sleep in the cave one after another. The man pulled Mo Yi'er and stopped not far from the fire. Then he patted the piece of rabbit skin on the ground, pointed at Mo Yi'er, and patted it again. Mo Yi'er probably understood that he wanted her to sleep here. Mo Yi'er nodded and said, \"Thank you!\" The man didn't understand, so he didn't say any polite words to Mo Yi'er. Mo Yi'er lay down directly on the animal skin. Seeing that she understood what she meant, the man smiled brightly. Then, he lay down behind Mo Yi'er. Under him was a piece of animal skin with the same pattern as his body. Mo Yi'er could see clearly now that it seemed to be tiger fur, dark yellow with black stripes on it. Mo Yi'er felt very embarrassed. There were more than twenty people living in the cave, and they all slept together, including men and women. This feeling made her, who came from the 21st century and was used to sleeping in a room by herself, very uncomfortable. However, do as the Romans do, you need to take a good rest and then decide what to do tomorrow. At least, you must learn to communicate first! While she was drifting off to sleep, a very strange sound rang in Mo Yi'er's ears. After listening for two minutes, Mo Yi'er suddenly realized, isn't this the kind of melodious sound that often appears in porn movies from a certain island country? The whole person suddenly woke up. Even though she was unexperienced and under the influence of modern technology, she also knew what was going on! Damn it, primitive people live in groups. In the huge cave, they say OOXX is OOXX. Have you considered other people's feelings? And there were more than just a couple of OOXX. The loud and unabashed moans made Mo Yi'er's face turn red and her scalp numb. After listening to it for a few minutes, she couldn't help but stand up and walk out of the cave. There were several men in disguise standing guard outside the cave, seemingly on sentinel duty. When they saw Mo Yi'er coming out, they said something to him with a tigerish face. Mo Yi'er couldn't understand and could only look at them in confusion. The movement outside the cave soon woke up the sleeping man, the handsome guy who rescued Mo Yi'er. Although Mo Yi'er couldn't understand what they were saying, she could still hear the pronunciation of their call to him - Ban Ge. Weird name isn't it? Ban Ge came over, seemed to be asking about his companions, said a few words, and then pulled Mo Yi'er back. Mo Yi'er's face was still slightly red. She pointed inside the cave, refusing to go in, and then pointed outside, meaning she wanted to stay outside for a while. Bange didn't understand and was very anxious. He just pulled her hard and didn't let her go anywhere. Mo Yi'er was very stubborn, but the howling of wolves in the distance made her heart tremble. She looked at Ban Ge, her eyes filled with water, looking pitiful. Damn it, my sister’s trick works every time. Back then, my sister would always be made soft-hearted by this trick, and then let herself do whatever she wanted! However, Mo Yi'er miscalculated today. Maybe primitive people didn't even have that loving string. Ban Ge half dragged and half dragged Mo Yi'er back to the cave, pressed her on the rabbit skin, and then looked at her with his arms around his shoulders, with a hint of threat in his eyes! Mo Yi'er immediately wanted to go crazy, but after thinking about it, even this primitive man couldn't understand it, so let's forget it! With such tangled emotions, those melancholy sounds were dispersed in her ears, and Mo Yi'er endured the discomfort and fell asleep. What she didn't know was that after she fell asleep, Bange's eyes were filled with smiles. Primitive people were accustomed to resting at sunset and working at sunrise. When a flash of white light appeared on the horizon, they would wake up from their sleep, and everyone would get up and start their busy day. Mo Yi'er was sleeping soundly when she was woken up by these loud voices. Primitive people had no sense of the immorality of making noise, so they started chirping at the top of their lungs. Mo Yi'er had no choice but to sit up. The fat nightgown made her seem even thinner. Her clothes looked so out of place in the cave. Within a few minutes, all the men in the cave disappeared, leaving only a few old people, children, and a pregnant woman. Mo Yi'er came outside the cave. Some women were walking away holding animal skins, while others were drying the wild boar meat they had hunted yesterday on the open space in front of the cave. Mo Yi'er stretched out and wanted to wash her face and brush her teeth as usual, but she couldn't find the water anywhere. She wanted to ask, but she couldn't understand the language, so she had to look for it by herself. However, after taking a few steps, she was pulled by a woman. This woman is very tall, 180cm tall. Not only her, but every one of these primitive people is taller than Mo Yi'er and very strong. Mo Yi'er turned to look at the woman, looking at her with doubtful eyes. The woman screamed at Mo Yi'er. Although she was shouting, she couldn't see the slightest disrespect. Instead, there was a hint of uneasiness in her eyes. Mo Yi'er was confused, what on earth was she talking about? Simply ignore it and continue walking out. But the woman's arms were tightly locked and she wouldn't let go. Mo Yi'er finally realized that the woman wouldn't let her leave. She just stayed in their cave for one night, so was she imprisoned? He looked around, looking for the man who brought him back. Apparently he could communicate with him to some extent, but unexpectedly, there was no man outside the cave. Mo Yi'er could only go back to the cave door and sit down dejectedly. Now no one could stop her from doing anything. The woman went to the side to dry her meat again, but her eyes looked at Mo Yi'er from time to time, which seemed to be a surveillance. Mo Yi'er sat in silence for a long time, and then walked back to the cave. The sleepy children also got up and played in the cave. A few old people sat in the depths of the cave like rotten wood, saying something from time to time. Mo Yi'er thought for a while and walked towards them. Several old people noticed her approach and cheered up, with smiles on their lips.", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}